    "Attack Attribute": "Unholy 20",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy -13, Unholy 189",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 An evil witch of a heretical religion who serves Antharas and sacrifices humans in her rituals. By using Dark Arts on herself, she was able to transform her body into that of a powerful evil spirit. She and her minions will attack any invaders who disrupt Antharas' sleep. Through a lifetime of slaughter, she has transformed into a powerful creature of evil. Now, she enjoys eating human hearts still pumping with warm blood. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
